sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API
    participant E as Quality engine
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>F: Choose an asset and a CSV file
    F->>A: POST quality run, multipart file
    A->>A: Authenticate, check membership, load the asset
    A->>A: Check file name, content type and size
    A->>E: Parse CSV, check limits, analyze with server-side rules
    E-->>A: Scores, profile, per-rule results, issues
    A->>D: Begin transaction
    A->>D: Insert quality run
    A->>D: Insert quality issues
    A->>D: Insert audit event
    A->>D: Commit
    A-->>F: 201 with the run and audit event ID
    F->>A: GET run history, run detail and issues
    A-->>F: Persisted results
    F-->>U: Scores, rule results and filterable issues
